# Signing keys, for EVERY acquisition directory present or future.
#
# This was previously a list of specific directories, which meant each new
# acquisition needed a new line and silently was not covered until someone
# remembered. Two were missed -- live/g6-work/keys/ and
# live/satroot-bind-work/keys/ -- and 26 private keys reached the public
# repository as a result. A pattern cannot be forgotten the way a list can.
live/*/keys/
live/sandwich-work/keys/
live/g2b-work/keys/
live/race_sandwich.log
live/race_g2b.log
live/g5-work/keys/
live/race_g5.log
dist-archive/
fpga/sim/*.vvp

# Rehearsal sessions. A challenge with no sky target and no anchor proves
# nothing, and indoor test frames are megabytes of noise in an evidence
# repository. Real sessions -- g2b-work, g5-work, g6-work -- stay tracked.
live/*-rehearsal/
